WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.427
We begin with the basic structure of a function: define it, then call it.

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:12.767
Next, parameters make the function flexible, return values let us reuse results elsewhere,

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:19.088
docstrings help explain the purpose, and function composition lets small pieces work together.

00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:23.785
The goal is to think of a function as a named analytical step.

00:00:23.785 --> 00:00:30.422
Inputs go in, the function performs one clear job, and useful results come back out.
